@startuml uml_ch10_a2a_protocol_sequence
!include ../common/book-clean.puml
title A2A Client and Server — Sequence

participant "A2A client" as client
participant "A2A server" as server
participant "agent\n(any framework)" as agent

== Discovery ==

client -> server : HTTP GET /.well-known/agent-card.json
note right: standardized by A2A —\na single GET at the\nserver's well-known URI

server --> client : Agent Cards
note right: one card per agent\nthe server exposes

== Task execution ==

client -> server : send task (JSON-RPC)
activate server

server -> agent : runs the task
activate agent
note right: outside the protocol —\nA2A does not specify what\nperforms the task
agent --> server : result
deactivate agent

server --> client : result or error
deactivate server
note right: long-running tasks may stream\nprogress or push a completion\nnotification instead

@enduml
